  description: 'If an "S-Force" monster you control would banish a card(s) from your
    hand to activate its effect, you can send 1 "S-Force" card from your Deck to
    the GY instead, except "S-Force World Sorting". If another card(s) is banished
    (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 card in your opponent''s field
    or GY; banish it, then you can move 1 "S-Force" monster you control to another
    of your Main Monster Zones. You can only use each effect of "S-Force World Sorting"
    once per turn.'
